<Placemark><name>#2 Richmond — St Margarets / East Twickenham, near Orleans Park (TW1)</name><styleUrl>#spot</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>#2</b> Richmond — St Margarets / East Twickenham, near Orleans Park (TW1)<br><b>Verdict:</b> Close second: an outstanding comprehensive in reach, several fall-backs, and within budget. New from the Richmond search.<br><b>Primary:</b> Orleans Primary (0.4 km; cut-offs 1.45–2.22 km in 2022–26) and St Stephen's CofE (spare places 2026); Deer Park (Outstanding, KS2 95%) only within ~400 m.<br><b>Secondary:</b> Orleans Park — comprehensive, mixed; A8 66.4, P8 +0.88, Outstanding; 0.5 km against 1.11–1.24 km by walking route. Back-ups: Teddington School (comprehensive, mixed; 3.5 km vs 5.1 km), the Green School for Girls (CofE comprehensive, girls; community places to 10 km) and the Richmond upon Thames School (comprehensive, mixed, A8 52.9).<br><b>Grammar route:</b> Tiffin Girls' (grammar) 3.3 km; TW1 is in its Designated Area.<br><b>Rent now:</b> £2071 pcm (2-bed flat) · travel £246.6 · total £2317.6<br><b>Main risk:</b> Orleans Park's walking cut-off has tightened each year (1.24 → 1.19 → 1.11 km), so stay within ~0.8 km on foot. Richmond primary data for 2024–25 is missing (2022, 2023 and 2026 are in). Richmond rents rose 5.4%; listings median £2,450.]]></description><Point><coordinates>-0.315000,51.454500,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
