<Placemark><name>#3 Wimbledon — Dundonald Rd / Kingston Rd (SW19 3)</name><styleUrl>#spot</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>#3</b> Wimbledon — Dundonald Rd / Kingston Rd (SW19 3)<br><b>Verdict:</b> Safest London pair of comprehensives (two High), but the schools are a notch below Kingston Academy and Orleans Park.<br><b>Primary:</b> Dundonald (inside its priority area; 0.38–0.61 km) and Pelham (1.10–1.27 km); Merton Abbey offered every applicant.<br><b>Secondary:</b> Harris Academy Wimbledon — comprehensive, mixed (10% music places); A8 55.8, P8 +0.62, Outstanding; 1.1 km against 1.61–1.92 km. Ricards Lodge — comprehensive, girls; A8 57.8, P8 +0.66, Outstanding; 1.2 km against 2.60–3.18 km. Both High.<br><b>Grammar route:</b> Tiffin Girls' (grammar) 6.8 km; SW19 is in its Designated Area. Nonsuch and Wallington: open places only.<br><b>Rent now:</b> £2367 pcm (2-bed flat) · travel £201.6 · total £2568.6<br><b>Main risk:</b> Merton rents rose 5.5% last year (about £2,630 by 2028). Dundonald's priority-area boundary matters: check the address.]]></description><Point><coordinates>-0.205500,51.417400,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
