<Placemark><name>#4 Epsom &amp; Ewell — Epsom west, Stamford Green (KT18 7/KT19 8)</name><styleUrl>#spot</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>#4</b> Epsom & Ewell — Epsom west, Stamford Green (KT18 7/KT19 8)<br><b>Verdict:</b> Best outside London and the most certain on both phases. A house rather than a flat.<br><b>Primary:</b> Stamford Green (Outstanding; 1.10–1.49 km cut-off outside its catchment) and Southfield Park (spare places).<br><b>Secondary:</b> Rosebery — comprehensive, girls; A8 61.6, P8 +0.79, Outstanding; 1.4 km against 2.68–3.29 km. Blenheim — comprehensive, mixed, A8 51.1; 1.1 km against 3.1–4.0 km. Both High, with big margins.<br><b>Grammar route:</b> Nonsuch (grammar) 4.3 km: inside its 5.25 km circle, which has up to 125 places for local girls. Tiffin Girls' Designated Area (KT18/19).<br><b>Rent now:</b> £2317 pcm (3-bed house/flat) · travel £280.4 · total £2597.4<br><b>Main risk:</b> Few 3-bed houses come up at once. The commute is longer (Epsom to Waterloo/Victoria about 35–40 min). There is no strong mixed comprehensive; the strong option is girls-only.]]></description><Point><coordinates>-0.280200,51.340700,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
