<Placemark><name>#5 St Albans — Marshalswick (AL4 9)</name><styleUrl>#spot</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>#5</b> St Albans — Marshalswick (AL4 9)<br><b>Verdict:</b> Strong on both phases, but the dearest commute. The best St Albans option for secondary.<br><b>Primary:</b> Skyswood (Outstanding, KS2 88%; 0.49–0.80 km) and Wheatfields Infants (Outstanding; 1.40 km); St John Fisher (Catholic) had spare places.<br><b>Secondary:</b> Sandringham — comprehensive, mixed; A8 65.7, P8 +1.06, Outstanding; 0.45 km, distance-only (Herts doesn't publish the last km). STAGS (comprehensive, girls) by lottery.<br><b>Grammar route:</b> Partially selective: Dame Alice Owen's (37.5% by test), Parmiter's and Watford Girls' (35%).<br><b>Rent now:</b> £2455 pcm (3-bed house/flat) · travel £440.5 · total £2895.5<br><b>Main risk:</b> Sandringham's last distance is unpublished. Little stock under £2,850 right now, and the highest commute cost.]]></description><Point><coordinates>-0.301500,51.770000,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
