<Placemark><name>#6 Mortlake / East Sheen (SW14)</name><styleUrl>#spot</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>#6</b> Mortlake / East Sheen (SW14)<br><b>Verdict:</b> Excellent and cheap for primary; secondary is the weak link.<br><b>Primary:</b> Thomson House (Outstanding), Sheen Mount, East Sheen (Outstanding) and St Mary Magdalen's all had places for everyone in 2026. Thomson House's 2023 cut-off was 0.49 km.<br><b>Secondary:</b> Lift Richmond Park — comprehensive, mixed; A8 51.8 (just over the 'strong' bar), P8 +0.49; 0.7 km, High. Chiswick (comprehensive, A8 51.1) is borderline by walking route. No top-tier comprehensive (A8 60+) in reach.<br><b>Grammar route:</b> Tiffin Girls' (grammar) 5.0 km; SW14 is in its Designated Area.<br><b>Rent now:</b> £2552 pcm (2-bed flat) · travel £201.6 · total £2753.6<br><b>Main risk:</b> The secondary is solid rather than top-tier. Primary data is mostly 2023 and 2026.]]></description><Point><coordinates>-0.268000,51.465000,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
