<Placemark><name>#7 Clapham — Between the Commons / Northcote Rd (SW11 1/6)</name><styleUrl>#spot</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>#7</b> Clapham — Between the Commons / Northcote Rd (SW11 1/6)<br><b>Verdict:</b> Best schools per square mile in London, but over budget.<br><b>Primary:</b> Belleville (Outstanding; 0.89–1.21 km) and Honeywell Infant (KS2 84%; 0.78–1.41 km); several schools nearby had spare places.<br><b>Secondary:</b> Ark Bolingbroke — comprehensive, mixed; A8 56.2, P8 +1.04. High via feeder places if Vera attends Belleville or Honeywell. Chestnut Grove (banded) Medium.<br><b>Grammar route:</b> Graveney and Burntwood: partially selective, 25% by the Wandsworth test. SW11 is outside Tiffin's Designated Area.<br><b>Rent now:</b> £3045 pcm (2-bed flat) · travel £171.7 · total £3216.7<br><b>Main risk:</b> Rent is over the £3,000 ceiling for typical stock (£2,775–3,045 now, rising about 4% a year).]]></description><Point><coordinates>-0.165000,51.456000,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
