<Placemark><name>#8 St Albans — Fleetville, near Oakwood (AL1 4/AL4 0)</name><styleUrl>#spot</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>#8</b> St Albans — Fleetville, near Oakwood (AL1 4/AL4 0)<br><b>Verdict:</b> Top for primary, but secondary is a gamble; Marshalswick is the safer St Albans base.<br><b>Primary:</b> Fleetville Infant (Outstanding; 0.84–1.19 km) and Oakwood (1.05–2.95 km): both High.<br><b>Secondary:</b> Beaumont — comprehensive, mixed; A8 63.0, P8 +0.89. Medium: it is your nearest school, but nearest-school applicants were offered only to 0.69 km in 2025 (1.36 km in 2026). STAGS by lottery; Sandringham unknown at 1.8 km.<br><b>Grammar route:</b> Partially selective: Dame Alice Owen's, Parmiter's, Watford Girls'.<br><b>Rent now:</b> £2400 pcm (3-bed house/flat) · travel £440.5 · total £2840.5<br><b>Main risk:</b> Secondary hinges on Beaumont's radius, which swung 0.69–1.36 km in two years.]]></description><Point><coordinates>-0.308500,51.754800,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
