<Placemark><name>#9 St Albans — Bernards Heath (AL3 5)</name><styleUrl>#spot</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>#9</b> St Albans — Bernards Heath (AL3 5)<br><b>Verdict:</b> Solid, but costlier commute than the London options.<br><b>Primary:</b> Bernards Heath Infant and Alban City offered every applicant; Maple and Garden Fields are tight.<br><b>Secondary:</b> STAGS — comprehensive, girls; A8 60.7, P8 +0.55: High, as it is your nearest eligible school. Sandringham Medium (1.6 km, distance unpublished).<br><b>Grammar route:</b> Partially selective: Dame Alice Owen's, Parmiter's, Watford Girls'.<br><b>Rent now:</b> £2459 pcm (3-bed house/flat) · travel £440.5 · total £2899.5<br><b>Main risk:</b> A good fit for a girl (STAGS); weaker for a mixed school.]]></description><Point><coordinates>-0.326720,51.762750,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
