<Placemark><name>#10 Barnes — village / Church Rd (SW13 0/9)</name><styleUrl>#spot</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>#10</b> Barnes — village / Church Rd (SW13 0/9)<br><b>Verdict:</b> Lovely, but expensive for what the state schools offer.<br><b>Primary:</b> Barnes Primary (Outstanding) only within ~0.4 km (0.24–0.56 km). Lowther, East Sheen and St Mary Magdalen's had spare places.<br><b>Secondary:</b> Lift Richmond Park (comprehensive, A8 51.8) High. Fulham Cross Girls' (comprehensive, girls, A8 58.1) offered everyone in 2025. West London Free School by ballot within 2 miles.<br><b>Grammar route:</b> Tiffin Girls' (grammar) 6.6 km; SW13 is in its Designated Area.<br><b>Rent now:</b> £2985 pcm (2-bed flat) · travel £201.6 · total £3186.6<br><b>Main risk:</b> Rent is at the ceiling now (£2,985 Hutch; £3,000 median) and rising. Hurlingham, Lady Margaret's open places and Christ's are out of reach.]]></description><Point><coordinates>-0.242700,51.471600,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
