<Placemark><name>#11 Epsom &amp; Ewell — Stoneleigh (KT17 2/KT19 0)</name><styleUrl>#spot</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>#11</b> Epsom & Ewell — Stoneleigh (KT17 2/KT19 0)<br><b>Verdict:</b> Good for primary and for an 11+ family. Otherwise weaker than Epsom west.<br><b>Primary:</b> Meadow (cut-off 1.50 km; 0.8 km away) plus The Mead, Cuddington Community and West Ewell (spare places).<br><b>Secondary:</b> Blenheim — comprehensive, mixed, A8 51.1: High. The strong comprehensives (Cheam, Rosebery, Harris Sutton) are out of reach.<br><b>Grammar route:</b> Nonsuch (grammar) 1.8 km, inside its 5.25 km circle: the strongest grammar position of any spot.<br><b>Rent now:</b> £2394 pcm (3-bed house/flat) · travel £212.8 · total £2606.8<br><b>Main risk:</b> Without Nonsuch, the comprehensive option is only above average.]]></description><Point><coordinates>-0.247110,51.363070,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
