<Placemark><name>St Elizabeth's Catholic Primary School</name><styleUrl>#pgood</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[Primary · Academy converter (Catholic) · Ofsted Outstanding · KS2 RWM 82% · <b>good primary</b><br>Cut-offs: tightest – km, widest – km (2024–26) · comfort radius nodata<br>2023: Oversubscribed – no distance published · 2024: Oversubscribed – no distance published · 2025: Oversubscribed – no distance published · 2026: No data<br>Measured: shortest walking route (road/footpath) for community schools; straight line at Deer Park, St Elizabeth's, Thomson House<br>2027/28 policy, PAN 30: 1 Catholic looked after; 2 baptised Catholic with Certificate of Catholic Practice; 3 other baptised Catholic; 4 other looked after; 5 Eastern Orthodox; 6 sibling; 7 other faiths; 8 any other. Within each: sibling, designated parish, need, staff (2+ yrs), then straight-line distance from school entrance; lots for ties.<br>Sources: <a href="https://reports.ofsted.gov.uk/provider/21/149925">ofsted</a> · <a href="https://api.education.gov.uk/statistics/v1/data-sets/019afee4-e5d0-72f9-9a8f-d7a1a56eac1d/query?indicators=IwjBz,i2s6X,ODwCL&amp;filters.in=EXcPq&amp;locations.in=SCH|urn|102910">results</a> · <a href="https://www.st-elizabeths.richmond.sch.uk/page/?title=Admissions&amp;pid=48">admissions</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>-0.290201,51.456653,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
